    Source of Truth for completed tasks: JSON log built from the task board.


    - Reads the «✅ Done» column from the board.


    - Adds to SoC only tasks that weren''t logged before (completed_at = run date).


    - On first run (empty file), all current tasks in «Done» are logged with completed_at
    = null,


    to avoid a spike in the graph — only new completions after this are counted.


    - Run at a reasonable interval (daily or during vault_maintenance).



    File: 300_Dashboards/Charts/completed_tasks_soc.json

